Match data can be found at: https://www.tennisabstract.com/charting/20250409-M-Monte_Carlo_Masters-R32-Francisco_Cerundolo-Carlos_Alcaraz.html

Description of Upload:
- Match between Francisco Cerundolo vs Carlos Alcaraz at the 2025 Monte Carlo Masters R32

Purpose of Project:
- Identification of momentum shifts and delved into the underlying details and complexities of player performance
- The momentum shifts being analyzed were not just binary (one player winning or losing) but involved intricate variations in performance and game dynamics.
- The analysis aimed to provide a clear and comprehensive understanding of these nuanced shifts to gain insights into the match and player strategies

Metrics Evaluated: 
- First_pct: First serve percentage (percentage of successful first serves)
- Second_pct: Second serve percentage (percentage of successful second serves)
- Winners_FH: Forehand winners (points won directly from a forehand shot)
- Winners_BH: Backhand winners (points won directly from a backhand shot)
- UFE_FH: Forehand unforced errors (errors made on a forehand shot without being forced by the opponent)
- UFE_BH: Backhand unforced errors (errors made on a backhand shot without being forced by the opponent)
- RPW_pct: Return points won percentage (percentage of points won when returning the opponent's serve)

Packages Required: 
- tidyverse, patchwork, zoo, corrplot
- Avaliable as pdf if needed 
